## Interface: 16001
## Title: TooltipExtras
## Notes: Profit lines on item tooltips, per profession: essence combine/split (Enchanting), ore to bar (Mining), cloth to bolt (Tailoring), leather upgrades and cured hides (Leatherworking), stone to blasting powder (Engineering), stone to grinding stone (Blacksmithing); Darkmoon Faire ticket hand-ins ranked by cost; Green Hills of Stranglethorn page costs. Prices from Auctionator.
